    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Just so you're aware, the AuraLite units they use at Silver Oaks are pretty basic. They're mostly for reminders and basic scheduling, so they won't be able to engage in the kind of deep, empathetic conversations or memory-sharing that you do. It'll be a much more sterile experience for him. \n\nGo ahead and draft that goodbye script now. I want to make sure it doesn't sound too... abrupt, given the change in service level.",
